    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Sep 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，时隔一年多，我又开始录播客啦～这一年发生了很多事情，也有了很多变化，来我的声音树洞吐露一下心声吧。</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>👂「本期内容」</span></strong></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>为什么我又录播客了？</span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1">00:01</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>近期情况简单回顾</span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>展开讲讲两次裁员的经历</span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>1.海外版</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>2.本土版</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>对比两次失业我的状态</span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>失业带给我的思考</span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="639">10:39</a></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>1.不断去思考，我到底适合做什么？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>2.对教培行业祛魅</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>3.要学会认命 但不服输</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>关于接下来的打算</span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1119">18:39</a></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🚩立下Flag——稳定输出播客，摩拳擦掌准备下一期节目去啦！</span></p>]]></description>
